{"updated":"2026-10-10T08:48:44.416Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Live: Russian strikes on Ukraine's Zaporizhzhia kill at least seven, including children. Elsewhere, hurricane Isaias downgraded after making landfall in Florida. And a decade of Lajee Celtic: The Palestinian club whose fans include Cantona. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 2.3 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 1.4 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 4.2 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 83 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 7.7 near 12 km WSW of Pitaloza Arriba, Panama. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.2,0.22,0.26,0.31,0.35,0.38,0.43,0.48,0.5,0.52,0.56,0.58,0.63,0.76,0.85,1,1.32,1.44,1.49,1.52,1.54,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.66,1.72,1.76,1.85,1.92,1.96,2,2.03,2.08,2.11,2.15,2.19,2.24,2.28,2.31,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.51,2.54,2.62,2.68,2.76,2.88,3,3.17,3.2,3.24,3.27,3.33,3.38,3.45,3.54,3.62,3.68,3.75,3.8,3.84,3.89,3.94,3.98,4,4.03,4.09,4.11,4.13,4.16,4.2,4.25,4.33,4.39,4.46,4.54,4.6,4.71,4.75,4.81,4.83,4.89,5,5.16,5.33,5.84,5.92,6.09,6.14,6.27,6.32,6.59,6.66,6.72,6.77,6.8,6.86,6.91,6.95,7.02,7.07,7.13,7.2,7.28,7.35,7.4,7.43,7.48,7.51,7.55,7.66,7.75,7.84,7.89,7.95,8,8.03,8.08,8.1,8.13,8.22,8.29,8.41,8.47,8.54,8.6,8.7,8.75,8.87,8.99,9.1,9.22,9.27,9.32,9.38,9.51,9.58,9.64,9.96,10.09,10.12,10.18,10.23,10.28,10.31,10.37,10.44,10.53,10.61,10.73,10.79,10.86,10.94,11.09,11.21,11.27,11.36,11.41,11.47,11.52,11.57,11.62,11.66,11.68,11.74,11.78,11.83,11.89,11.95,12.02,12.07,12.12,12.2,12.38,12.98,13.1,13.15,13.21,13.26,13.29,13.34,13.38,13.43,13.49,13.53,13.57,13.63,13.68,13.72,13.76,13.83,13.87,13.99,14.03,14.06,14.12,14.21,14.33,14.44,14.51,14.59,